message: >-
  If you use DockMate-VS, please cite version 0.1.3 using the release URL
  below and the associated SoftwareX article when available. A version-specific
  Zenodo DOI will be added after archival; the concept DOI identifies the
  version series, not this exact release.
title: DockMate-VS
type: software
authors:
