abstract: >-
  A spreadsheet-driven desktop application for reproducible molecular-docking
  protocol development, native-pose recovery, control enrichment, rescoring,
  virtual screening, and result inspection.
keywords:
  - molecular docking
  - virtual screening
  - protocol development
  - cheminformatics
  - reproducible research
